EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

As you are aware, we have issued a legal demand on the account due to {!Case.FRPSA_Breach__c}. We have been attempting to come to a resolution regarding your account. If you do not contact us the account will be reported to business credit as a defaulted account and the file will be sent to our litigation team for evaluation and handling.

To help avoid that outcome, we would like to offer you some options to settle the account prior to possible litigation.  Please contact us as soon as possible so we can work together to resolve the defaulted account.  We look forward to hearing from you.


Thank you,

{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}



